  comp_doc["Component Docs"]:::system

  business_idea -->|Captured| brd_business
  brd_business --> solution_mapper
  solution_mapper -->|Solution shape| brd_component
  component_idea -->|Captured| brd_component
  brd_component --> slicer
  slicer -->|Component slices| designer
  designer -->|LLD| nurture
  nurture -->|Code & specs| kbe
  kbe -->|Extracted knowledge| graph_server
  graph_server --> ama
  graph_server --> dexter
  graph_server --> comp_doc

